---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import CodeTabs from '../islands/CodeTabs.mjs'
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <section class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-10">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-200">
        Astro + Glimlit
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-[2.65rem]">
        Gleam for the logic.
        <br />
        <span class="text-teal-200">lit-html for the view.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
        Build static pages with Astro. Bring a small part to life with Glimlit:
        typed models and updates in Gleam, HTML-like views with lit-html, and
        effects for browser work.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
        <a
          href="/demos/"
          class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-teal-200 px-5 py-3 font-medium text-slate-950 hover:bg-teal-100"
        >
          Explore the examples →
        </a>
        <a href="/demos/postcard/" class="text-teal-200 hover:underline">
          Try Postcard Studio
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <CodeTabs client:load class="min-h-[30rem] min-w-0" />
  </section>
  <section class="mt-14 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Model the decisions</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        Gleam holds meaningful application state and updates it with explicit
        messages.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Stay close to the browser</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        lit-html views use native elements, properties, and events. Tailwind
        styles both pages and apps.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Give work a place</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        Effects and subscriptions handle saving, fetching, routing, and keyboard
        shortcuts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
